@host = http://localhost:5179
# Paste a JWT from POST /api/v1/auth/login. Test with several roles (SuperAdmin, Director,
# Department Head, Project Manager, Team Member) and compare against the older endpoints
# noted next to each request.
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Dashboard summary (replaces 6 calls). Compare totals with GET /projects/dashboard and GET /tasks/dashboard-summary
GET {{host}}/api/v1/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1b. Same, limited to one department (must be 403 for a department the user cannot access)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/dashboard/summary?departmentId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000&topProjects=5&escalations=5&activityDays=14
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Projects ranked by urgency (delayed first, then AI delay risk)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/projects/urgency?limit=8
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. My work. utcOffsetMinutes=330 is India (UTC+5:30)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/me/work?utcOffsetMinutes=330&horizonDays=7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Project health timeline (12 weeks). Replace the id with a project you can access
GET {{host}}/api/v1/projects/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/health-timeline?weeks=12
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Global search (needs 2+ characters; sections you lack permission for come back empty)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/search?q=road&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Mark all notifications read (already existed; the UI just did not call it yet)
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Team activity summary (zero-filled days). Compare with GET /activitylogs/team
GET {{host}}/api/v1/activitylogs/team/summary?days=7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
